#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:1
msgid "有界 I/O 生命周期属性矩阵"
msgstr "Bounded I/O lifecycle property matrix"

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:3
msgid ""
"`tools/testing/io_lifecycle_matrix.json` 索引当前 F4 与显式 Native 测试的有限属性。 每项绑定真实生产"
" TU、模型、Google case、断言、调用链、不变量和限制。退役平台行 不进入当前索引；条目数量随真实覆盖维护，不从旧台账继承通过数。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/testing/io_lifecycle_matrix.json` indexes bounded properties of "
"current F4 and explicitly scoped Native tests. Each entry binds actual "
"production TUs, models, Google cases, assertions, call chains, invariants and"
" limitations. Retired-platform rows do not enter the current index. Entry "
"counts follow actual maintained coverage and do not inherit passed counts "
"from older ledgers."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:7
msgid ""
"所选 F407 HAL `dma-tx` 属性独立关联 `uart_hal.c`、共享 RX／冷态／Core、锁定官方 源码及实际 "
"runtime、cold 和 generated factory case。LL 行不能按相似名字重绑 HAL。 元数据检查或 capture "
"成功不表示执行了全部 case，也不表示硬件通过。"
msgstr ""
"The selected F407 HAL `dma-tx` properties separately bind `uart_hal.c`, "
"shared RX/cold/Core code, locked official sources and the actual runtime, "
"cold and generated-factory cases. LL rows must not be rebound to HAL based on"
" similar names. Successful metadata checks or capture do not mean that every "
"case executed or that hardware passed."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:11
msgid "唯一执行链路"
msgstr "One execution chain"

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:13
msgid "执行既有命令："
msgstr "Run the maintained command:"

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:19
msgid ""
"门禁先执行 doctor 和 Native configure/compile/link preflight；失败时不进入 工具测试。工具测试后再次 "
"configure/build 当前 CMake `nexus_google_contracts`， 随后 capture 绑定当前 "
"catalogue、CMake executable plan、compile database、已编译对象、 各目标 "
"binary，以及明确列出的生产/测试/模型/公共合同源码 SHA256。每个 provider 与测试 TU 必须属于指定 Google target "
"的真实编译上下文；共享 Core/I/O TU 保留实际库对象与命令。缺少对象或目标不能退化为源码名匹配。 capture 同时从这份实际 compile"
" database 保存所选目标全部本地 TU 的 源码、对象和编译命令身份，包括 build 目录生成的 factory `bindings.c`。 "
"源码必须位于当前 checkout 或当前 build，对象必须位于当前 build 的对应 "
"target；缺失对象、symlink、越界路径或执行期间改变生成源码/对象都拒绝。 这份观察结果复用 CMake 图，不注册另一份构建图。"
msgstr ""
"The gate first runs doctor and a Native configure/compile/link preflight; "
"failure prevents tool-test execution. After tool tests, it configures/builds "
"current CMake `nexus_google_contracts` again. Capture then binds the current "
"catalogue, CMake executable plan, compilation database, compiled objects, "
"each target binary, and explicit SHA256 identities for "
"production/test/model/public-contract sources. Each provider and test TU must"
" belong to its specified Google target's actual compilation context; shared "
"Core/I/O TUs retain real library objects and commands. Missing objects or "
"targets cannot fall back to matching source names. Capture also saves source,"
" object and command identities for every local TU in selected targets from "
"that actual compilation database, including generated factory `bindings.c` in"
" the build directory. Sources must reside in the current checkout or build, "
"and objects in the corresponding current-build target. Missing objects, "
"symlinks, out-of-bound paths and changes to generated sources/objects during "
"execution are rejected. This observation reuses the CMake graph rather than "
"registering another build graph."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:31
msgid ""
"原有 runner 完成全部 discovery 和无过滤执行，保存命令、退出码和 fresh XML。 audit "
"再检查输入未改变，discovery、XML 与 execution summary 的 case identity "
"完全一致，并确认每个索引属性确实完成。提交门禁要求整个 CMake Google plan 执行完成，不能使用 "
"`allow_subset`。成功后才生成："
msgstr ""
"The existing runner performs complete discovery and unfiltered execution, "
"retaining commands, return codes and fresh XML. Audit rechecks that inputs "
"are unchanged, that discovery, XML and execution-summary case identities "
"match exactly, and that every indexed property completed. The commit gate "
"requires the entire CMake Google plan to finish and cannot use "
"`allow_subset`. Only success produces:"

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:36
msgid "`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-inputs.json`：执行前输入身份。"
msgstr ""
"`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-inputs.json`: pre-execution input identities."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:37
msgid "`build/<preset>/tdd/execution.json`：唯一 runner 的实际全部执行结果。"
msgstr ""
"`build/<preset>/tdd/execution.json`: the sole runner's actual complete "
"execution results."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:38
msgid "`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-report.json`：绑定上述实际结果的有限属性。"
msgstr ""
"`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-report.json`: finite properties bound to "
"those actual results."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:40
msgid ""
"新一轮开始会删除旧 summary 和属性报告；失败不会留下上一轮成功报告。 实际执行成功而 audit 失败时，保留原始 execution "
"供定位，但不生成合格属性报告。"
msgstr ""
"A new round deletes old summaries and property reports; failures cannot leave"
" previous success reports. If execution succeeds but audit fails, raw "
"execution remains for diagnosis but no qualified property report is "
"generated."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:43
msgid "属性边界"
msgstr "Property boundaries"

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:45
msgid ""
"断言 anchor 只用于可审查的源码导航。工具排除注释、字符串和其他 case 中的 同名断言，不能自动证明断言的逻辑意义。模型必须真实执行生产 "
"provider； 硬件依赖被显式模拟，模型结果不能提升为实板波形、电气或物理时序资格。"
msgstr ""
"Assertion anchors provide reviewable source navigation only. The tool "
"excludes comments, strings and same-named assertions in other cases but "
"cannot automatically prove an assertion's logical meaning. Models must "
"execute actual production providers; hardware dependencies are explicitly "
"modeled, and model results cannot establish board waveform, electrical or "
"physical timing qualification."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:49
msgid ""
"当前重点包括 admission 无残留、epoch/取消、loan 保留、停失败隔离与重试、 最终 IRQ/DMA "
"撤销、迟到错误、计数/loss、FIFO/LIFO 流贷款、有限 deadline、 "
"连续接收替换地址和资源枯竭。它不是所有寄存器组合、所有控制器、所有事件 交错或形式化证明。新增属性包括 CAN abort/domain/loss、USB"
" FIFO/clock/ SETUP epoch、Ethernet descriptor/held RX token，以及 generated "
"factory 的 失败清理、foreign cold 拒绝、权限和 timer 输出 readback 顺序。GPIO/Flash/ 基本 "
"PWM/watchdog 等其他 suite 不从本矩阵推导覆盖。完整未证明范围列在 catalogue 的 `unproven` 中。"
msgstr ""
"Current focus includes residue-free admission, epochs/cancellation, loan "
"retention, quarantine/retry after failed stop, final IRQ/DMA withdrawal, late"
" errors, counts/loss, FIFO/LIFO stream loans, finite deadlines, continuous-"
"receive target replacement and resource exhaustion. This is neither all "
"register combinations, all controllers, all event interleavings nor formal "
"proof. Added properties include CAN abort/domain/loss, USB FIFO/clock/SETUP "
"epochs, Ethernet descriptors/held RX tokens, and generated-factory failure "
"cleanup, foreign-cold rejection, permissions and timer-output readback order."
" Other GPIO/Flash/basic PWM/watchdog suites derive no coverage from this "
"matrix. The catalogue's `unproven` field lists the complete unproved scope."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:58
msgid ""
"factory 属性真实调用当前生成入口；模型只替代外部 CPU/MMIO 端口。部分 assertion 使用 fixture 的窄 "
"`Initialize` 或已声明 provider 宏，审查必须沿 该 fixture 的定义确认实际生产入口，不能把任意 helper "
"名称解释为生产证明。 断言导航绑定整个源码和已编译上下文，仍不自动分析条件编译内每条断言的 可达性。各目标仅建立其实际选择编译分支的有限行为。"
msgstr ""
"Factory properties actually call current generated entries; models replace "
"only external CPU/MMIO ports. Some assertions use a fixture's narrow "
"`Initialize` or declared provider macros. Review must follow fixture "
"definitions to confirm the real production entry rather than interpret "
"arbitrary helper names as production proof. Assertion navigation binds whole "
"sources and compiled contexts but does not automatically analyze reachability"
" of every assertion under conditional compilation. Each target establishes "
"finite behavior only for its actually selected branch."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:64
msgid ""
"捕获的是列出的 TU、所选 target 的本地 TU、模型和合同以及实际命令/对象， 不宣称自动分析完整头文件 依赖闭包或验证机器码语义。clean-"
"source SDK、候选源闭包、离线重现和实板 仍由各自交付门禁建立。属性报告明确 `formal_proof=false` 和 "
"`hardware_status=not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Capture covers listed TUs, selected targets' local TUs, models, contracts, "
"and actual commands/objects. It does not claim automatic analysis of the "
"complete header dependency closure or machine-code semantics. Clean-source "
"SDKs, candidate source closure, offline reproduction and physical boards "
"remain established by their respective delivery gates. Property reports "
"explicitly state `formal_proof=false` and `hardware_status=not_executed`."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:70
msgid ""
"开发者可用脚本的 `capture`/`audit` 子命令检查已有执行。显式 `--allow-subset` 只产生 `development-"
"subset`，用于开发定位；它不会替代 提交门禁或软件候选。脚本不运行测试，不建立第二份目标图，也不在 MCU 实例 加入 "
"instrumentation、RAM、worker 或 vtable 槽。"
msgstr ""
"Developers may use the script's `capture`/`audit` subcommands to inspect "
"existing execution. Explicit `--allow-subset` produces only `development-"
"subset` for diagnosis; it cannot replace the commit gate or a software "
"candidate. The script neither runs tests nor creates a second target graph, "
"and adds no instrumentation, RAM, worker or vtable slot to MCU instances."

#: docs/design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md:75
msgid ""
"新增模式或修正 provider 后，应复审不变量、真实断言、模型和 limitations， "
"再由新的构建和执行绑定当前源码；历史测试计数和哈希不能继承为新源的资格。 原 80 项开发矩阵和原始日志保持历史字节不变；233 项必须由当前源码重新 "
"capture/build/execute/audit，不能把旧报告的成功状态扩展到新增属性。"
msgstr ""
"After adding modes or fixing providers, review invariants, real assertions, "
"models and limitations, then bind current sources through fresh build and "
"execution. Historical test counts and hashes cannot become qualification for "
"new sources. Original 80-property development matrices and raw logs preserve "
"their historical bytes; the 233 properties require current-source "
"capture/build/execute/audit, never extension of old successful reports to new"
" properties."
